<title>USA: Nationsbank to acquire Montgomery Securities.</title>
<headline>Nationsbank to acquire Montgomery Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp. said on Monday it agreed to acquire closely held investment bank Montgomery Securities for $1.2 billion in the latest combination of a commercial bank and a brokerage house.</p>
<p>Montgomery will retain substantial autonomy, the two companies said, and will become part of NationsBanc Capital Markets Inc., a subsidiary that will be renamed NationsBanc Montgomery Securities Inc. Thomas Weisel, chief executive of Montgomery, will become chairman of the unit.</p>
</text>
